			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance Element submodule — Maintain Rust formatting and bundler profile coverage\n\nAdvance the Element submodule to de6fd335, incorporating a Maintain submodule update from 5d2f7439 to e641fa3d that reformats Rust test files (tests/Eliminate.rs, tests/test_rhai_config.rs, and examples/test_rhai_config.rs) to satisfy rustfmt style by removing blank-line separators between struct fields, match arms, function bodies, and test cases. The Rhai configuration example extends bundler profile verification to include bundler-preparation, swc-bundle, and oxc-bundle profiles.\n\nAll changes are test infrastructure formatting and coverage extensions with no functional behavior changes.",
